@host = http://localhost:5000

### Upload a document with metadata
POST {{host}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "Contract_Acme.txt",
  "project": "Apollo",
  "customer": "Acme",
  "type": "Contract",
  "content": "The Acme contract renews on 1 March 2027. Notice must be given 90 days before renewal."
}

### Find documents by context (project / customer / type)
GET {{host}}/documents?project=Apollo

### Ask a question (RAG with citations)
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "When does the Acme contract renew?" }

### Ask the agent (tool calling, limited to allowed projects)
POST {{host}}/agent
Content-Type: application/json
X-Allowed-Projects: Apollo

{ "question": "Which contracts do we have for Acme, and when does the newest one renew?" }
